# The corpus and everything derived from it stays on the machine that built it.
#
# Licence: restricted-educational-internal. The page-truth corpus is NBF/FBISE
# textbook content; the segmentation JSONs, the FDE breakdowns and every
# rendered lesson plan are derivations of it. They are for Taleemabad internal
# educational and research use and are NOT redistributed — and this repo is a
# public fork. What is committed here is the build CODE and the spec, both of
# which are ours; what the code reads and what it renders are not.
#
# Point the build at a local corpus with SEG_DIR / FDE_DIR / SKILLSMAP_JSON.
corpus/
seg/
fde/
skillsmap.json
renders/
*.render.json

# Build and test scratch
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The Rule 23/24 verification exports — each one is a PDF of a live tab and a
# PNG rendered from it, read back to check the formatting. They are pictures of
# the segmented corpus, so they are derivations too, and they are scratch: the
# loop re-exports them every time a painter changes.
*.pdf
*.png
